LocaleTest
├── inferCurrencyFromHostname
│   ├── given a single-part country TLD
│   │   └── it maps single TLDs
│   ├── given a two-part country TLD
│   │   └── it maps two-part TLDs
│   └── given a TLD it does not know
│       └── it returns null for unknown TLDs
└── resolveAmbiguousSymbol
    ├── given a dollar sign
    │   └── it resolves $ by TLD
    ├── given a yen sign
    │   └── it resolves ¥ by TLD and page language
    └── given a symbol that means one thing
        └── it returns null for unambiguous symbols
